                    {
                        "sense_id": "70f0cd77-6ff0-3aa0-8cc0-8d48f71892af",
                        "entry_id": "88353788-7b81-34eb-8f54-7c9b9d066a18",
                        "glosses": [
                            "комп. запоминающее устройство, используемое в качестве буфера между процессором и памятью в компьютерных системах"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c7ac9a20-5e57-3029-8185-ab114af226d4",
                        "entry_id": "88353788-7b81-34eb-8f54-7c9b9d066a18",
                        "glosses": [
                            "комп., прогр. память, предназначенная для хранения промежуточных результатов, а также часто используемых данных и команд"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3bfda2be-1dc1-4310-85e3-a9a6ae30f4fb",
                        "source_entry_id": "88353788-7b81-34eb-8f54-7c9b9d066a18",
                        "target_lang_word": "cache",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cache",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9fc71bcf-18e2-367a-bf2c-3ac84f333618",
                                        "entry_id": "9d4e2f86-d78d-395f-bd13-f828a4c127f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A store, protected or hidden in some way, of things that may be required in the future, such that they can be retrieved rapidly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "907d3a09-21fb-495f-942b-b958a4881426",
                                                "sense_id": "9fc71bcf-18e2-367a-bf2c-3ac84f333618",
                                                "text": "Members of the 29-man Discovery team laid down food caches to allow the polar team to travel light, hopping from food cache to food cache on their return journey."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5052bd9f-ebc9-43a1-b546-7a3092455679",
                                                "sense_id": "9fc71bcf-18e2-367a-bf2c-3ac84f333618",
                                                "text": "I came across a cache of old photos / And invitations to teenage parties"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09939fdc-d4d5-3e57-a425-33b46911b499",
                                        "entry_id": "9d4e2f86-d78d-395f-bd13-f828a4c127f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fast temporary storage where recently or frequently used information is stored to avoid having to reload it from a slower storage medium."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb91441b-4242-3623-a5b6-a244f865be3a",
                                        "entry_id": "9d4e2f86-d78d-395f-bd13-f828a4c127f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A container containing treasure in a global treasure-hunt game."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "cache",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b8ff5762-373c-3afa-8531-bfa41743fa6d",
                                        "entry_id": "b96e0df1-f7aa-3e3e-b018-651c835ee17c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To place in a cache."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9be3b87-fdbc-422c-b3e9-5ca065920940",
                                                "sense_id": "b8ff5762-373c-3afa-8531-bfa41743fa6d",
                                                "text": "And here the adventurers went ashore, unloaded, turned their canoe bottom up in the shelter of thick brush, and cached their supplies temporarily on a pole scaffold, out of reach of prowling depredators."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c9a6840-2a28-3d74-bc73-2b30bfc31f30",
                                        "entry_id": "b96e0df1-f7aa-3e3e-b018-651c835ee17c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To store data in a cache."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14a35c3d-33e3-4208-840f-d3e3ca0d37f0",
                                                "sense_id": "0c9a6840-2a28-3d74-bc73-2b30bfc31f30",
                                                "text": "In this case, it would not be ideal to use the full-page caching that the per-site or per-view cache strategies offer, because you wouldn't want to cache the entire result (since some of the data changes often), but you'd still want to cache the results that rarely change."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac91bf2c-21fb-3ef4-a7bc-751fd5a1b5ab",
